{"term":{"label":"信","occurrences":4,"variants":[]},"source":{"id":"6A","url":"https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-i","title":"告子上","description":"告子曰：「性，猶杞柳也；義，猶桮棬也。以人性為仁義，猶以杞柳為桮棬。」\n孟子曰：「子能順杞柳之性而以為桮棬乎？將戕賊杞柳而後以為桮棬也？如將戕賊杞柳而以為桮棬，則亦將戕賊人以為仁義與？率天下之人而禍仁義者，必子之言夫！」\n告子曰：「性猶湍水也，決諸東方則東流，決諸西方則西流。人性之無分於善不善也，猶水之無分於東西也。」"},"network":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"form":"一","id":"一"},{"form":"下","id":"下"},{"form":"仁","id":"仁"},{"form":"今","id":"今"},{"form":"信","id":"信"},{"form":"內","id":"內"},{"form":"善","id":"善"},{"form":"外","id":"外"},{"form":"必","id":"必"},{"form":"性","id":"性"},{"form":"日","id":"日"},{"form":"桮","id":"桮"},{"form":"棬","id":"棬"},{"form":"水","id":"水"},{"form":"義","id":"義"},{"form":"飲","id":"飲"}],"edges":[{"weight":2.34660197841082,"source":"信","target":"水"},{"weight":1.9411368703026557,"source":"信","target":"仁"},{"weight":1.7047480922384253,"source":"信","target":"義"},{"weight":1.0248461384285006,"source":"仁","target":"桮"},{"weight":1.0248461384285006,"source":"仁","target":"棬"},{"weight":1.7692866133759964,"source":"仁","target":"義"},{"weight":0.23638877806423034,"source":"仁","target":"下"},{"weight":1.9411368703026557,"source":"仁","target":"必"},{"weight":1.7179933189884458,"source":"仁","target":"內"},{"weight":1.2479896897427103,"source":"仁","target":"外"},{"weight":1.0248461384285006,"source":"仁","target":"水"},{"weight":0.554842509182765,"source":"仁","target":"一"},{"weight":0.842524581634546,"source":"仁","target":"今"},{"weight":3.039749158970765,"source":"日","target":"飲"},{"weight":1.6534547978508747,"source":"日","target":"水"},{"weight":1.8765983491650844,"source":"日","target":"一"},{"weight":1.6534547978508747,"source":"內","target":"外"},{"weight":1.4816045409242156,"source":"內","target":"義"},{"weight":2.2512917986064953,"source":"必","target":"下"},{"weight":1.7047480922384253,"source":"必","target":"義"},{"weight":0.5465437063680699,"source":"下","target":"善"},{"weight":0.1112256351102244,"source":"下","target":"性"},{"weight":1.33500106673234,"source":